{"id":"vod_bf_25591","vodId":"25591","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"偶像大师","name_cn":"偶像大师","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-26/d215cb5c1747eb1202eb27072d9bb98f.jpg"},"summary":"在娱乐视听高度发达的当下，少女偶像不仅圆了许多人的梦，也令很多情窦初开的女孩找到人生前进的方向。小型艺能公司765事务所便云集了12位性格各异但拥有着共同梦想的女孩子，她们是天海春香（中村绘里子 配音）、星井美希（长谷川明子 配音）、如月千早（今井麻美 配音）、高槻やよい（仁后真耶子 配音）、萩原雪步（浅仓杏美 配音）、菊地真（平田宏美 配音）、双海亚美（下田麻美 配音）、双海真美（下田麻美 配音）、水濑伊织（钉宫理惠 配音）、三浦あずさ（たかはし智秋 配音）、四条贵音（原由实 配音）、我那霸响（沼仓爱美 配音）。事务所新人男性担任摄影师，跟踪记录下女孩们成长的每一天。曾经当过偶像的制作人秋月律子（若林直美 配音）则耐心引领着少女们一步步向偶像殿堂迈进。　　光明之路纵使充满坎坷，但没有人会拒绝品尝胜利果实的那一刻……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 09:46:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ouxiangdashi/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.